---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import Discussion from '../../components/Discussion.astro';
import ProductCard from '../../components/ProductCard.astro';
import ProjectArtwork from '../../components/ProjectArtwork.astro';
import BuildPartsChecklist from '../../components/BuildPartsChecklist.astro';
import {projects,productBySlug} from '../../lib/catalog';
import type{Project} from '../../data/projects';
import {buildReferences} from '../../data/build-references';
import {projectGuides} from '../../data/project-guides';
import {plannedVariantForProject,projectBomMissingParts,formatUsd} from '../../data/catalog-staging';
export function getStaticPaths(){return projects.map(project=>({params:{slug:project.slug},props:{project}}));}
interface Props{project:Project}
const {project}=Astro.props;
const reference=buildReferences[project.slug];
const guide=projectGuides[project.slug];
const buildRepo='https://github.com/polygoku/makhex/tree/main/builds/'+project.slug;
const agentFile='https://github.com/polygoku/makhex/blob/main/builds/'+project.slug+'/README.md';
const materials=project.materials.map(m=>({...m,product:productBySlug(m.slug),planned:plannedVariantForProject(m.slug,project.slug)}));
const plannedPartsSubtotal=materials.reduce((sum,m)=>sum+(m.planned?.plannedRetailUsd??0)*m.qty,0);
const missingParts=projectBomMissingParts[project.slug]??[];
const total=project.materials.reduce((n,m)=>n+m.qty,0);
const ld={'@context':'https://schema.org','@type':'HowTo',name:project.title,description:project.summary,step:project.steps.map((text,i)=>({'@type':'HowToStep',position:i+1,text})),url:'https://makhex.com/projects/'+project.slug+'/'};
---
<BaseLayout title={project.title+' | MAKHEX'} description={project.summary}>
<div class="container breadcrumb"><a href="/">HOME</a><span>/</span><a href="/projects/">PROJECTS</a><span>/</span><span>{project.number}</span></div>
<section class="project-detail-hero container"><div><span class="eyebrow">MAKHEX PROJECT / {project.number} • {project.eyebrow}</span><h1>{project.title}<span class="heading-star">✳</span></h1><p>{project.summary}</p><div class="project-tag-row"><span>{project.level}</span><span>{project.time}</span><span>{project.category}</span></div><a class="btn btn-primary" href="#bill-of-materials">SEE THE PARTS LIST ↓</a> <a class="btn btn-outline" href={`/projects/${project.slug}.csv`}>DOWNLOAD BOM CSV ↓</a> <a class="btn btn-outline" href="#discussion">JOIN DISCUSSION ↓</a></div>
{reference ? <div class="project-detail-poster real-reference-poster">
<img class="real-reference-photo" src={reference.image} alt={reference.alt} width="1080" height="760" loading="eager"/>

<span class="detail-poster-caption real-reference-poster-caption">Photo credit: {reference.builder}</span>
</div> : <div class="project-detail-poster"><ProjectArtwork project={project}/><span class="detail-poster-caption">Concept sketch · proposed build, not yet bench-verified</span></div>}</section>
<section class="container guide-intro"><div class="content-section"><span class="eyebrow">WHAT YOU WILL MAKE</span><h2>The idea, in practice.</h2><p class="guide-overview">{guide.overview}</p><div class="guide-use-cases"><h3>Where it is useful</h3><ul>{guide.useCases.map(item=><li>{item}</li>)}</ul></div></div><div class="guide-links"><span class="eyebrow">SOURCE AND WALKTHROUGH</span><h3>Build with an open repo.</h3><p>MAKHEX is a proposed adaptation. Reference media is credited to its original creator, not a claim of a finished MAKHEX prototype.</p><a class="btn btn-primary" href={buildRepo} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">MAKHEX PROJECT REPO →</a><a class="btn btn-outline" href={agentFile} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">AI AGENT BUILD INSTRUCTIONS ↗</a>{reference&&<a class="text-link" href={reference.sourceUrl} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">ORIGINAL CREATOR REPO ↗</a>}{guide.video&&<a class="text-link" href={guide.video.url} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" >{guide.source?'WATCH PROJECT DEMO ↗':'WATCH ORIGINAL BUILD VIDEO ↗'}</a>}{guide.video&&!guide.source&&<small>Video by {guide.video.creator}; it demonstrates the creator's hardware, not this MAKHEX kit.</small>}{guide.video&&guide.source&&<small>Demo video shows an independent prototype. Hardware, software and language support may differ from a future MAKHEX kit.</small>}</div></section>
<section class="container project-body-grid"><div><div class="content-section" id="bill-of-materials"><span class="eyebrow">01 / BILL OF MATERIALS</span><h2>What goes in.</h2>
<div class="bom-table"><div class="bom-row bom-heading"><span>COMPONENT</span><span>ROLE</span><span>QTY</span></div>{materials.map(m=><div class="bom-row"><span>{m.product?<a href={'/shop/'+m.slug+'/'}>{m.product.title} ↗</a>:m.slug}</span><span>{m.why}{m.planned&&<small class="bom-line-estimate">{formatUsd(m.planned.plannedRetailUsd*m.qty)}</small>}</span><strong>{String(m.qty).padStart(2,'0')}</strong></div>)}</div>
<div class="bom-total"><span>{materials.length} UNIQUE PART TYPES</span><span>{total} ITEMS</span></div>
<div class="project-price-planner simple-project-subtotal"><span>Parts subtotal</span><strong>{materials.every(m=>m.planned)?formatUsd(plannedPartsSubtotal):'Price pending'}</strong></div>
<p class="project-price-note">Planned research prices only · U.S. delivery, tax, and missing parts not verified. No checkout until qualified.</p>
{missingParts.length>0&&<div class="project-bom-gaps-simple"><strong>Still needed</strong><ul>{missingParts.map(gap=><li>{gap}</li>)}</ul></div>}
<BuildPartsChecklist project={project}/></div>
<div class="content-section"><span class="eyebrow">BEFORE POWER-UP</span><h2>Check these first.</h2><ul class="guide-checklist">{guide.beforeYouStart.map(s=><li>{s}</li>)}</ul></div>
<div class="content-section"><span class="eyebrow">02 / THE APPROACH</span><h2>Build sequence.</h2><ol class="steps-list">{project.steps.map((s,i)=><li><span>{String(i+1).padStart(2,'0')}</span><p>{s}</p></li>)}</ol></div>
<div class="content-section"><span class="eyebrow">SUCCESS CRITERIA</span><h2>Know when it works.</h2><ul class="guide-checklist">{guide.demoGoals.map(s=><li>{s}</li>)}</ul></div>
<div class="warning-box prominent"><strong>⚑ ENGINEERING NOTE</strong><p>{project.caution}</p><small>Concept-stage plan; bench validation and firmware QA pending.</small></div></div>
<aside class="project-aside"><div class="aside-card"><span class="eyebrow">THE QUICK SPEC</span><div><span>STATUS</span><strong>BLUEPRINT</strong></div><div><span>LEVEL</span><strong>{project.level.toUpperCase()}</strong></div><div><span>TIME</span><strong>{project.time.toUpperCase()}</strong></div><div><span>TECH</span><strong>{project.tech.join(' / ')}</strong></div></div>
<div class="aside-help"><span>FOR AI CODING AGENTS</span><p>Read the MAKHEX project README and compare the original maker's repo. Check the exact board, SDK, wiring and missing parts before editing firmware or suggesting replacements.</p><ul class="guide-agent-tasks">{guide.agentTasks.map(task=><li>{task}</li>)}</ul><a class="text-link" href={agentFile} target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">OPEN PROJECT AGENT CONTEXT ↗</a></div>
<div class="aside-help"><span>FOUND A BETTER WAY?</span><p>Share a correction, alternative firmware or tested supplier option.</p><a class="text-link" href="#discussion">JOIN THIS PROJECT DISCUSSION ↓</a></div></aside></section>
<div class="container"><Discussion projectSlug={project.slug} context={project.title}/></div>
<section class="section container"><div class="section-heading compact"><div><span class="eyebrow">COMPATIBLE CANDIDATES</span><h2>The building blocks.</h2></div><a class="text-link" href="/shop/">FULL CATALOG ↗</a></div><div class="product-grid">{materials.map(m=>m.product&&<ProductCard product={m.product}/>)}</div></section>
<script type="application/ld+json" set:html={JSON.stringify(ld)}/></BaseLayout>